WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Molnupiravir: an oral antiviral for at-risk Covid-19 outpatients.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
MOVe-OUT randomized 1433 participants unvaccinated, at-risk outpatients.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
In all randomized participants: 6.8% with molnupiravir versus 9.7% with placebo.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
A difference of −3.0 percentage points, down from −6.8 percentage points at the interim analysis.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Deaths through day 29: 1 with molnupiravir, 9 with placebo.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Molnupiravir reduced hospitalization or death, modestly. N Engl J Med, 2022. Scroll for the full breakdown.
